{"title": "The Speedy Lightfeet", "pageid": 1325, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Speedy_Lightfeet", "categories": ["Boots", "Rare items", "Sparkstruck set", "Sources of Lightning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png/300px-The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/7/7e/The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Speedy Lightfeet image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png/300px-The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">The Speedy Lightfeet</span></a> are a pair of rare <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a> that allow the wearer to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightning Charges\">Lightning Charges</a> when <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashing</a> in combat.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>It is said the Speedy Lightfeet were the first of many lightning inventions made by <a href=\"/wiki/Yrre\" title=\"Yrre\">Yrre</a> the Sparkstruck. The boots' old, frayed edges zap and crackle with even the slightest movement.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" title=\"Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boots\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 240 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  240  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">66be4e91-933b-44e8-a73c-3b8a9c6b14a8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:66be4e91-933b-44e8-a73c-3b8a9c6b14a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:66be4e91-933b-44e8-a73c-3b8a9c6b14a8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ChargedLightning_Dash_Boots+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Footwear_Metal_A_1</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/25px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/38px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/50px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Athletics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/25px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Speedy_Sparks\" title=\"Speedy Sparks\">Speedy Sparks</a></dt><dd>When the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dashes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashes</a> or takes a similar action in combat, they gain 3 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-711&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-412</span>: In a heavy chest in the cellar behind the windmill</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>It is not stated in-game, but Speedy Sparks activates at most once per turn, even when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashing</a> multiple times in a turn.</li>\n<li>While The Speedy Lightfeet appears ideal for <a href=\"/wiki/Rogues\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rogues\">rogues</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Barbarians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Barbarians\">barbarians</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">monks</a>, rogues and monks do not gain Medium Armour Proficiency from their class, and barbarians and monks lose the benefits of their respective <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\">Unarmoured</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\">Defense</a> traits if wearing The Speedy Lightfeet.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png/509px-The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png/764px-The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png/1018px-The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png/509px-The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/The_speedy_lightfeet_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200819\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2590/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34705/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7383/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1064/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1203866/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.199      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   66.199      1 -total\n 27.12%   17.955      8 Template:Icon_text\n 24.35%   16.119     24 Template:T